WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.850
A pure substance has one kind of particle; a mixture has two or more.

2
00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:10.025
Distilled water has only one kind of particle: a pure substance.

3
00:00:12.225 --> 00:00:15.700
Salt water has two kinds of particle: a mixture.

4
00:00:17.498 --> 00:00:21.198
Air is a mixture too, of several kinds of particle.
